SIDId signature database (sidid.cfg) — attribution and licence
==============================================================

The file `sidid.cfg` in this directory is the playroutine-signature database
from SIDId, vendored unmodified for use by `sid-analyzer`'s `playerid` module
and the `sid-playerid` binary.

Origin
------
- Tool:        SIDId V1.09 — "Quick & dirty HVSC playroutine identity scanner"
- Author:      Cadaver (Lasse Öörni, loorni@gmail.com), Covert Bitops
- Signatures:  contributed by Ian Coog, Ice00, Ninja, Yodelking,
               Wilfred/HVSC and Prof. Chaos
- Upstream:    https://github.com/cadaver/sidid
- Maintained alongside the High Voltage SID Collection (HVSC).
- A modern reimplementation of the tool: https://github.com/WilfredC64/player-id

`sid-analyzer` contains a clean-room Rust re-implementation of the SIDId
matching algorithm (see `crates/analyzer/src/playerid.rs`); the C source is not
copied. Only the data file `sidid.cfg` is redistributed here, under the licence
below.

